==Description==
The '''Fallen Nametag''' is a nametag that was obtained from a [[Fallen King Mini Plush]] code.

The '''Fallen Nametag''' has text that is colored with a white to purple vertical gradient and it has a black outline. It emits black and purple smoke, similarly to the [[Fallen King]] and other fallen enemies. It also emits small purple dots that move around it.

